<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Blackwater Live Test 1</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #1a1410;
    --panel: #2a2118;
    --border: #5c4a32;
    --gold: #c9a227;
    --gold-dim: #8a7020;
    --text: #e8dcc8;
    --text-dim: #a89878;
    --accent: #8b4513;
    --success: #4a7c59;
    --danger: #8b3a3a;
    --input-bg: #1f1812;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body {
    font-family: 'Segoe UI', Georgia, serif;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    min-height: 100vh;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .container {
    max-width: 920px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }
  header {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 2rem 0 1.5rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  header h1 {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    color: var(--gold);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
  }
  header p {
    color: var(--text-dim);
    margin-top: 0.4rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  .step-indicator {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .step-dot {
    width: 30px;
    height: 30px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--panel);
    border: 2px solid var(--border);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }
  .step-dot.active {
    background: var(--gold);
    border-color: var(--gold);
    color: #1a1410;
  }
  .step-dot.done {
    background: var(--success);
    border-color: var(--success);
    color: #fff;
  }
  .panel {
    background: var(--panel);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .panel h2 {
    color: var(--gold);
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .panel h3 {
    color: var(--gold-dim);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    margin: 1rem 0 0.5rem;
  }
  .hint {
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  label {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  input[type="text"], select, input[type="number"] {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem;
    background: var(--input-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 4px;
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  input[type="text"]:focus, select:focus, input[type="number"]:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: var(--gold);
  }
  .option-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(140px, 1fr));
    gap: 0.6rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .option-btn {
    padding: 0.7rem 0.5rem;
    background: var(--input-bg);
    border: 2px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 6px;
    color: var(--text);
    cursor: pointer;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    transition: all 0.15s;
  }
  .option-btn:hover {
    border-color: var(--gold-dim);
    background: #2f261c;
  }
  .option-btn.selected {
    border-color: var(--gold);
    background: #3a2e1a;
    color: var(--gold);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .option-btn.disabled {
    opacity: 0.35;
    cursor: not-allowed;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .feat-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }
  .feat-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0.75rem;
    background: var(--input-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 6px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.15s;
  }
  .feat-item:hover { border-color: var(--gold-dim); }
  .feat-item.selected {
    border-color: var(--gold);
    background: #2f2818;
  }
  .feat-item.disabled {
    opacity: 0.45;
    cursor: not-allowed;
  }
  .feat-item input {
    margin-top: 0.2rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    accent-color: var(--gold);
  }
  .feat-item .feat-content { flex: 1; }
  .feat-item .feat-name {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
  }
  .feat-item .feat-desc {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }
  .feat-item .prereq {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: #c97a4a;
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
  }
  .feat-item .tag {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    padding: 0.1rem 0.4rem;
    border-radius: 3px;
    margin-left: 0.4rem;
    vertical-align: middle;
  }
  .tag-combat { background: #5a3030; color: #f0a0a0; }
  .tag-ritual { background: #2a4a3a; color: #a0d0b0; }
  .tag-feat { background: #3a3a5a; color: #a0a0d0; }
  .count-bar {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
    background: var(--input-bg);
    border-radius: 6px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .count-bar .count {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .count-bar .count.full { color: var(--success); }
  .count-bar .count.over { color: var(--danger); }
  .btn-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  button.primary, button.secondary, button.danger {
    padding: 0.7rem 1.4rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
    border: none;
    transition: all 0.15s;
  }
  button.primary {
    background: var(--gold);
    color: #1a1410;
  }
  button.primary:hover { background: #d4b02e; }
  button.primary:disabled {
    background: #5a4a20;
    color: #8a7a50;
    cursor: not-allowed;
  }
  button.secondary {
    background: transparent;
    border: 2px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text);
  }
  button.secondary:hover {
    border-color: var(--gold-dim);
    color: var(--gold);
  }
  .sheet {
    background: #f5f0e6;
    color: #1a1410;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 2rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }
  .sheet h2 {
    color: #5c3a1a;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #8b6914;
    padding-bottom: 0.4rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .sheet h3 {
    color: #6b4a20;
    margin: 1.2rem 0 0.5rem;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }
  .sheet .meta {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 0.5rem 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .sheet .meta div { font-size: 0.95rem; }
  .sheet .meta strong { color: #5c3a1a; }
  .sheet ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; }
  .sheet li {
    padding: 0.5rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #d4c8b0;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }
  .sheet li strong { color: #5c3a1a; }
  .inventory-block {
    margin-top: 1.4rem;
    padding-top: 0.8rem;
    border-top: 2px solid #8b6914;
  }
  .inventory-block h3 { margin-top: 0; }
  .inv-meta {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }
  .inv-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    background: #fff;
  }
  .inv-table th {
    text-align: left;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #6b4a20;
    border-bottom: 1.5px solid #8b6914;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.4rem;
  }
  .inv-table td {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #c8bba0;
    height: 1.7rem;
    padding: 0.15rem 0.4rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    vertical-align: middle;
  }
  .inv-table td.qty { width: 3.2rem; text-align: center; }
  .inv-table td.notes { width: 38%; }
  .inv-table tr.blank td { color: transparent; }
  .sheet .stats {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.2rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin: 1rem 0;
    padding: 0.8rem;
    background: #ebe4d4;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }
  .sheet .stat { text-align: center; }
  .sheet .stat .num {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #5c3a1a;
  }
  .sheet .stat .label {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: #6b5a40;
  }
  .hidden { display: none !important; }
  .path-choice {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .path-btn {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 1rem;
    background: var(--input-bg);
    border: 2px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-align: center;
    transition: all 0.15s;
  }
  .path-btn:hover { border-color: var(--gold-dim); }
  .path-btn.selected {
    border-color: var(--gold);
    background: #3a2e1a;
  }
  .path-btn .path-title {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
  }
  .path-btn .path-desc {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }
  .summary-box {
    background: var(--input-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  .summary-box span {
    color: var(--gold);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .armor-card {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(160px, 1fr));
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .armor-option {
    padding: 1rem;
    background: var(--input-bg);
    border: 2px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-align: center;
    transition: all 0.15s;
  }
  .armor-option:hover { border-color: var(--gold-dim); }
  .armor-option.selected {
    border-color: var(--gold);
    background: #3a2e1a;
  }
  .armor-option.disabled {
    opacity: 0.35;
    cursor: not-allowed;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .armor-option .ap {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--gold);
  }
  .armor-option .name {
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0.3rem 0;
  }
  .armor-option .examples {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }
  .ap-breakdown {
    background: var(--input-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 1rem;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }
  .ap-breakdown table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
  }
  .ap-breakdown td {
    padding: 0.3rem 0.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .ap-breakdown td:last-child {
    text-align: right;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--gold);
  }
  .ap-breakdown tr.total td {
    border-bottom: none;
    border-top: 2px solid var(--gold);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    padding-top: 0.5rem;
  }
  .prep-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 0.75rem;
    background: var(--input-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 6px;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .prep-row .spell-info { flex: 1; }
  .prep-row .spell-name {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--gold);
  }
  .prep-row .spell-type {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }
  .prep-row input[type="number"] {
    width: 70px;
    margin: 0;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .prep-totals {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    padding: 0.8rem 1rem;
    background: var(--input-bg);
    border-radius: 6px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .prep-totals .pt {
    text-align: center;
  }
  .prep-totals .pt .num {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--gold);
  }
  .prep-totals .pt .lbl {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }
  @media print {
    @page { size: letter; margin: 0.3in; }
    html, body {
      background: #fff !important;
      color: #000 !important;
      font-size: 8pt;
      line-height: 1.15;
      -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;
      print-color-adjust: exact;
    }
    .no-print { display: none !important; }
    .container { max-width: 100%; padding: 0; margin: 0; }
    .panel {
      background: none !important;
      border: none !important;
      padding: 0 !important;
      margin: 0 !important;
      box-shadow: none !important;
    }
    .sheet {
      background: #fff !important;
      color: #000 !important;
      border: 1pt solid #333;
      border-radius: 0;
      padding: 0.12in 0.16in;
      margin: 0;
    }
    .sheet h2 {
      font-size: 13pt;
      margin: 0 0 0.06in 0;
      padding-bottom: 0.03in;
      border-bottom: 1pt solid #5c3a1a;
      color: #5c3a1a;
    }
    .sheet h3 {
      font-size: 8.5pt;
      margin: 0.06in 0 0.02in 0;
      color: #5c3a1a;
      border-bottom: 0.5pt solid #c0b090;
      padding-bottom: 0.02in;
    }
    .sheet .meta {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 0.02in 0.2in;
      margin-bottom: 0.05in;
      font-size: 8pt;
    }
    .sheet .stats {
      display: flex;
      gap: 0.22in;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin: 0.04in 0 0.05in 0;
      padding: 0.04in 0.08in;
      background: #ebe4d4 !important;
      border-radius: 2px;
      border: 0.5pt solid #c0b090;
    }
    .sheet .stat .num { font-size: 11pt; color: #5c3a1a; }
    .sheet .stat .label { font-size: 6.5pt; color: #555; }
    .sheet p, .sheet li {
      font-size: 7.5pt;
      margin: 0.01in 0;
      padding: 0.01in 0;
      line-height: 1.15;
    }
    .sheet ul { margin: 0.02in 0; padding: 0; }
    .sheet li {
      border-bottom: 0.5pt solid #ddd;
      padding: 0.02in 0;
    }
    .sheet .two-col {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 0.1in;
    }
    .sheet .compact-rules {
      font-size: 6.5pt;
      line-height: 1.15;
      color: #333;
      margin-top: 0.05in;
      padding-top: 0.03in;
      border-top: 0.5pt solid #c0b090;
    }
    .sheet .compact-rules strong { color: #5c3a1a; }
    .sheet .inventory-block { page-break-before: auto; break-before: auto; margin-top: 0.08in; }
    .sheet .inv-table td { height: 0.18in; font-size: 7.5pt; padding: 0 0.04in; }
    .sheet .inv-table th { font-size: 7pt; padding: 0.02in 0.04in; }
    .sheet .inv-meta { font-size: 7.5pt; margin-bottom: 0.04in; gap: 0.2in; }
    .sheet .screen-only { display: none !important; }
    .sheet .print-note { font-size: 7pt; margin: 0.04in 0 0 0; color: #333; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .option-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    .sheet .meta { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .path-choice { flex-direction: column; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
  <header class="no-print">
    <h1>Blackwater LARP</h1>
    <p>Character Creator</p>
  </header>

  <div class="step-indicator no-print" id="stepIndicator">
    <div class="step-dot active" data-step="1">1</div>
    <div class="step-dot" data-step="2">2</div>
    <div class="step-dot" data-step="3">3</div>
    <div class="step-dot" data-step="4">4</div>
    <div class="step-dot" data-step="5">5</div>
    <div class="step-dot" data-step="6">6</div>
    <div class="step-dot" data-step="7">7</div>
  </div>

  <!-- STEP 1: Name & Race -->
  <div class="panel no-print" id="step1">
    <h2>Step 1 — Name & Race</h2>
    <p class="hint">Race is purely for roleplay flair and how the world sees you. It has no mechanical effect.</p>
    <label for="charName">Character Name</label>
    <input type="text" id="charName" placeholder="Enter your character's name">
    <label>Race</label>
    <div class="option-grid" id="raceGrid"></div>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <button class="primary" id="toStep2" disabled>Next →</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- STEP 2: Profession -->
  <div class="panel no-print hidden" id="step2">
    <h2>Step 2 — Background Profession</h2>
    <p class="hint">Your profession is RP flair that helps you fit into the world, earn coin, and interact with other players. The economy is player-driven.</p>
    <label>Profession</label>
    <div class="option-grid" id="profGrid" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(160px, 1fr));"></div>
    <div id="profDesc" class="summary-box hidden"></div>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <button class="secondary" id="backTo1">← Back</button>
      <button class="primary" id="toStep3" disabled>Next →</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- STEP 3: Class -->
  <div class="panel no-print hidden" id="step3">
    <h2>Step 3 — Class</h2>
    <p class="hint">Everyone starts with 1 Life Point and chooses 4 feats/spells from their class list. Starting gear and gold differ by class.</p>
    <div class="option-grid" id="classGrid" style="grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;"></div>
    <div id="classDesc" class="summary-box hidden"></div>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <button class="secondary" id="backTo2">← Back</button>
      <button class="primary" id="toStep4" disabled>Next →</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- STEP 4: Feats / Spells -->
  <div class="panel no-print hidden" id="step4">
    <h2 id="step4Title">Step 4 — Feats & Spells</h2>
    <p class="hint" id="step4Hint">Select exactly 4 feats/spells. Some have prerequisites. Combat spells can later be prepared into your 6 combat slots.</p>

    <div id="pathSection" class="hidden">
      <h3>Choose your Path</h3>
      <div class="path-choice">
        <div class="path-btn" data-path="grace">
          <div class="path-title">Way of Grace</div>
          <div class="path-desc">Healing, protection, resurrection, holy smite</div>
        </div>
        <div class="path-btn" data-path="doom">
          <div class="path-title">Way of Doom</div>
          <div class="path-desc">Damage, fear, unholy smite, executioner</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="count-bar" id="featCountBar">
      <span>Selected: <span class="count" id="featCount">0</span> / 4</span>
      <span id="featWarning" style="color:var(--danger);font-size:0.9rem;"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="feat-list" id="featList"></div>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <button class="secondary" id="backTo3">← Back</button>
      <button class="primary" id="toStep5" disabled>Next →</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- STEP 5: Armor -->
  <div class="panel no-print hidden" id="step5">
    <h2>Step 5 — Armor</h2>
    <p class="hint">Choose your starting armor. Armor does <strong>not</strong> stack — you get the points from the type you wear (torso must be ≥80% covered). Feat and spell bonuses stack on top.</p>

    <div class="armor-card" id="armorOptions"></div>

    <div class="ap-breakdown" id="apBreakdown">
      <table>
        <tr><td>Base from armor</td><td id="apBase">0</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Feat / spell bonuses</td><td id="apBonus">0</td></tr>
        <tr class="total"><td>Total Armor Points</td><td id="apTotal">0</td></tr>
      </table>
      <p style="font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-dim);margin-top:0.6rem;" id="apNotes"></p>
    </div>

    <div class="btn-row">
      <button class="secondary" id="backTo4">← Back</button>
      <button class="primary" id="toStep6">Next →</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- STEP 6: Spell Preparation (casters) or Review -->
  <div class="panel no-print hidden" id="step6">
    <h2 id="step6Title">Step 6 — Combat Spell Preparation</h2>
    <p class="hint" id="step6Hint">Casters may prepare up to <strong>6 combat spells</strong> per long rest (2 hours). Assign how many of each combat spell you prepare. Rituals and non-combat abilities are always available and do not use these slots.</p>

    <div id="prepSection">
      <div class="count-bar">
        <span>Prepared: <span class="count" id="prepCount">0</span> / 6</span>
        <span id="prepWarning" style="color:var(--danger);font-size:0.9rem;"></span>
      </div>
      <div id="prepList"></div>
      <div class="prep-totals" id="prepTotals">
        <div class="pt"><div class="num" id="totalOrbs">0</div><div class="lbl">Orbs needed</div></div>
